**Q101. How would you add a new test, say "Pull-ups", to the system?**

Step 1 — `app/core/config.py`: Add to `TEST_REGISTRY`:
```python
"pull_up": {
    "label": "Pull-ups",
    "unit": "reps",
    "direction": "higher",
    "plausible_min": 0,
    "plausible_max": 50,
    "source": "...",
